The parser is adapted from Svelte's (https://github.com/sveltejs/svelte),
and its type declarations include Svelte's AST types. The published bundle
includes acorn (https://github.com/acornjs/acorn), and the type
declarations include @types/estree
(https://github.com/DefinitelyTyped/DefinitelyTyped). All are MIT licensed:

Svelte

Copyright (c) 2016-2025 Svelte Contributors
(https://github.com/sveltejs/svelte/graphs/contributors)

